					{
						"description": "The attacking unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.",
						"name": "Stealth",
						"type": "Core"
					},
					{
						"description": "ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER units with this ability have a psyker level of 1 or higher, specified in that unit's abilities. Each psychic ability has a psychic level of 1 or higher, specified in that ability's name.\nIn a battle round, a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER unit can use a number of psychic abilities whose total psychic level does not exceed that PSYKER unit's psyker level.\nExample: In a battle round, a psyker level 3 PSYKER unit could use three psychic level 1 abilities, or one psychic level 1 ability and one psychic level 2 ability, or one psychic level 3 ability.",
						"name": "Librarius",
						"type": "Faction"
					},
					{
						"description": "This model has the psychic abilities listed in the Psychic Abilities section.",
						"name": "Librarian",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "This unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against psychic attacks.",
						"name": "Psychic Hood",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "When an enemy unit targets this unit, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n• On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.\n• Attacks that target this unit have -1 to hit rolls until the end of the phase.",
						"name": "Shrouding",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					},
					{
						"description": "In your Shooting phase, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n• On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.\n• Select one visible enemy unit. Ranged attacks that target that enemy unit have [IGNORES COVER].",
						"name": "Soul Sight",
						"type": "Datasheet"
					}
				],
